ss, sort the center holes in reading order, and start one agent from each arm tip.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:283:    - Each agent keeps the original motion policy: turn right > go straight > turn left, with left forbidden on the border; straight moves are length 2 except immediately after a turn when they shrink to 1; arm-length-1 crosses still take the initial outward step.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:294:    \"\"\"Build a grid containing multiple plus-sign crosses with center holes.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:323:    owner_counts = [meta[\"owner_counts\"][i] for i in range(len(meta[\"crosses\"]))]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:325:        \"num_crosses\": len(meta[\"crosses\"]),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:326:        \"arm_lengths\": [cross[\"arm_len\"] for cross in meta[\"crosses\"]],\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:338:    num_crosses = 2 if arm == ARM_LEN_MAX else random.choice(NUM_CROSSES_CHOICES)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:353:            if len(centers) == num_crosses:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:355:        if len(centers) < num_crosses:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:360:        owner_counts = [meta[\"owner_counts\"][i] for i in range(len(meta[\"crosses\"]))]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/da515329/D13/1/code.py:363:        if len(meta[\"crosses\"]) != num_crosses:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5961cc34/D12/0/code.py:30:#    object types or hidden state. Uniform sampling across the four inward directions ensures\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5961cc34/D12/0/code.py:45:#    The same occupancy, dilation, and ray-intersection checks keep blobs separated and stop\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/5961cc34/D12/0/code.py:49:#    output always extends red away from that cap into the