> - 操作类：射线延伸/ray_cast, 反弹/bounce, 重涂色/recolor, 连线/draw_line, 填充/fill, 镜像/mirror, 透明叠加/overlay, 排序/sort, 拼接/concatenate, 计数/counting, 填充图例/populate_legend, 折叠/folding, 压缩/compression, 平移复制/translate_and_copy, 锚点对齐/anchor_alignment, 对齐/align, 擦除/erase, 印章覆盖/stamp, 区域提取/region_extract, 贪心选择/greedy_selection, 平移/shift, 背景替换/background_replace, 重力下落/gravity_drop, 补全/completion, 裁剪/crop, 拉伸/stretch, 逻辑交/logical_AND
