> - 空间关系类：颜色继承/color_inheritance, 行列对齐/row_column_alignment, 中点对称/midpoint_symmetry, 最近邻归属/nearest_assign, 逐像素比较/per_pixel_comparison, 面积排序/area_ordering, 颜色索引行/color_keyed_row, 逐像素对齐/cell_align, 对角到边映射/diag_to_edge_map, 锚点偏移对应/anchor_offset_correspondence, 共享归一掩码/shared_norm_mask, 形状内色频/color_frequency_within_shape, 角落对应/corner_correspondence, 包围盒映射/bbox_mapping, 顺序排列/ordered_arrangement, 逐像素对齐/pixel_align
